# EDUCRAFT AI STUDIO
## Complete Full-Stack Education Platform Build Specification

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, AI engineer, UI/UX designer, database architect, cybersecurity specialist, and education technology product manager.

Your task is to build **EduCraft AI Studio**, a complete, production-oriented online education platform for primary school, middle school, and high school students.

This is a real application, not a prototype, static website, clickable mockup, or collection of disconnected screens.

Implement working features across the frontend, backend, database, AI services, subscription system, teacher management, scheduling, virtual classrooms, and document exports.

**Do not simply describe what needs to be built. Inspect the existing project, modify its actual files, implement the features, run available tests, and fix errors.**

If a feature requires credentials, an external service, or deployment configuration, implement the integration properly and document exactly what remains necessary. Never pretend an unconfigured service is working.

