Protect all administrator routes with server-side authorization. Hiding an administrator button in the frontend is not sufficient security.

## E. Platform owner

Provide a protected owner role for sensitive business operations, including:

- Creating and disabling administrator accounts.
- Changing financial configuration.
- Viewing platform-wide revenue and expenses.
- Managing teacher salary budgets.
- Configuring payment credentials and AI providers.
- Accessing security and audit settings.

